{"data":{"body":"[P2] Enforce the preview budget while traversing\n\nThe entire JSON tree is flattened into `PreviewEntry` objects before `maxPreviewBytes` is considered. For the large documents this stage is intended to offload, a 4 KB preview can still allocate paths and converted values for every field and potentially exhaust memory. Integrate insertion and size accounting into traversal so collection stops as soon as the budget is full.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ocgWJ","finding_digest":"5569849aaa6f231cfcab68b6fef126eb700831658d28e1c3d0a4d8d653c1b3aa","finding_id":"arf_v1_kvuyjgvkn4rrz7flnc3p54jg5n","finding_key":"serdes-preview::build-preview::budgeted-traversal","identity_key":"serdes-preview::build-preview::budgeted-traversal","line":72,"observation_digest":"bfd9e45e309987e9d5c5cc42a25d1414cdb5ba33b4a634f982d57590ee01dbb4","observation_id":"aro_v1_x7m6ixrqtgd6tvofzrbkexiuct","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/serde/filesystem/SerDesPreview.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T00:57:43Z","review_id":"arr_v1_f4j3wxl4w7tjcxk3ncd67glqoe","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"bd098098c29efddab8c781e68c7500bf030b1190","reviewer":"codex","start_line":71,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":648},"record_id":"art_v1_oyq47fwa3gikorrbg2dar64wvp","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T00:57:43Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
